  - id: DEMO_BAD
    title: "Kh\xF4ng k\u1ECBp t\u1EDBi n\u01A1i tr\xFA \u1EA9n"
    subtitle: "M\xC0N 2 \xB7 NG\u01AF\u1EDCI TH\u1EE8 N\u0102M"
    chapter: 2
    ending: 1
    description: "Nam ch\u1ECDn sai \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng. Ti\u1EBFng d\xE9p d\u1EEBng ngay sau l\u01B0ng. Khi ngo\u1EA3nh l\u1EA1i, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF \u0111\xE3 \u1EDF s\xE1t b\xEAn.\n\n\u0110\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn kh\xE9p l\u1EA1i t\u1EA1i \u0111\xE2y. Th\u1EED l\u1EA1i t\u1EEB checkpoint v\xE0 nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1EDBi ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD."
    narration: 
    isTitleCard: 0
    placeholderColor: {r: 0.12, g: 0.02, b: 0.02, a: 1}
    presentBackground: {fileID: 0}
    pastBackground: {fileID: 0}
    hotspots: []
  - id: DEMO_M2_SHRINE
    title: "Ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD \xB7 Qua \u0111\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn"
    subtitle: "M\xC0N 2 \xB7 NG\u01AF\u1EDCI TH\u1EE8 N\u0102M"
    chapter: 2
    ending: 0
    description: 
    narration: "Nam ch\u1EA1y qua ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD. Ba ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n theo v\xE0o. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF d\u1EEBng ngo\xE0i c\u1EEDa.\n\nS\xE1ng mai, c\u1EA3 nh\xF3m s\u1EBD t\xECm hi\u1EC3u chuy\u1EC7n nh\xE0 ch\u1EE7 c\u0169.\n\nM\xE0n 3\u20138 \u0111ang \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n. K\u1EBFt th\xFAc th\u01B0\u1EDDng s\u1EBD n\u1EB1m \u1EDF M\xE0n 8."
    isTitleCard: 0
    placeholderColor: {r: 0.24, g: 0.18, b: 0.12, a: 1}
    presentBackground: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0ae44d4e12aafdb48afaed9c5cc7bd50, type: 3}
    pastBackground: {fileID: 0}
    hotspots: []
  clues:
  - id: M1_NOTE_CLUE
    title: "L\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFn trong t\u1EE7"
    body: "Nam, d\u1ECDn \u0111\u1ED3 xong th\xEC xu\u1ED1ng \u0103n nh\xE9. Bia \u0111ang \u1EDF ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch, B\u0103ng lo b\u1EEFa c\u01A1m, B\u1EA3o v\u1EEBa \u0111i mua \u0111\u1ED3.\n\nNh\xE0 v\u1ED1n l\xE0 nh\xE0 \u1EDF c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD h\xE0ng b\xEAn n\u1ED9i, b\xE0 cho thu\xEA r\u1EBB \u0111\u1EC3 gi\xFAp sinh vi\xEAn v\xE0 nh\u1EDD tr\xF4ng nh\xE0. Ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD l\xE0 ph\xF2ng ri\xEAng \u1EDF t\u1EA7ng 2, \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED3 ch\u1EAFn c\u1EEDa. \u2014 Bia"
  - id: M1_BOWL_CLUE
    title: "B\xE1t c\u01A1m th\u1EE9 n\u0103m"
    body: "B\u1ED1n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, nh\u01B0ng tr\xEAn m\xE2m c\xF3 th\xEAm m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc b\xE1t nh\u1ECF m\u1EBB mi\u1EC7ng. Nam nh\xECn k\u1EF9 hoa v\u0103n tr\xEAn th\xE0nh b\xE1t.\n\nV\u1EEBa quay \u0111i h\u1ECFi c\xE1c b\u1EA1n r\u1ED3i nh\xECn l\u1EA1i, chi\u1EBFc b\xE1t \u0111\xE3 kh\xF4ng c\xF2n \u1EDF ch\u1ED7 c\u0169. Ch\u01B0a ai gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
  - id: M1_MIRROR_CLUE
    title: "B\xF3ng ph\xEDa sau trong g\u01B0\u01A1ng"
    body: "Sau khi r\u1EEDa m\u1EB7t, Nam ng\u1EA9ng l\xEAn th\u1EA5y b\xF3ng m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF sau l\u01B0ng. Nam ch\u01B0a nh\u1EADn ra \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 ai."
  - id: M1_HAND_CLUE
    title: "D\u1EA5u b\xE0n tay nh\u1ECF"
    body: "Nam quay l\u1EA1i: kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ai. Khi nh\xECn v\u1EC1 g\u01B0\u01A1ng l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa, s\xE1t m\xE9p d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xF3 m\u1ED9t d\u1EA5u b\xE0n tay nh\u1ECF. B\u1EC1 m\u1EB7t g\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EABn l\u1EA1nh."
  - id: M1_ROUTE_CLUE
    title: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u1EBFn ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD"
    body: "T\u1EA7ng 1: ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc; ph\xF2ng ng\u1EE7 1 b\xEAn tr\xE1i; c\u1EA7u thang b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i; b\u1EBFp v\xE0 WC 1 ph\xEDa sau, c\u1EEDa ph\u1EE5 ra s\xE2n sau.\n\nT\u1EA7ng 2: h\xE0nh lang gi\u1EEFa nh\xE0; ph\xF2ng ng\u1EE7 2 ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc b\xEAn tr\xE1i; PH\xD2NG TH\u1EDC RI\xCANG ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i; ph\xF2ng ng\u1EE7 3 ph\xEDa sau b\xEAn tr\xE1i; WC 2 ph\xEDa sau b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i.\n\nPh\xF2ng th\u1EDD y\xEAn t\u0129nh kh\xE1c th\u01B0\u1EDDng. K\xFD hi\u1EC7u d\xF2ng h\u1ECD tr\xEAn \u0111\u1ED3 th\u1EDD gi\u1ED1ng v\u1EADt Nam mang b\xEAn m\xECnh. Ch\u01B0a bi\u1EBFt \xFD ngh\u0129a hay t\xE1c d\u1EE5ng."
  - id: M1_DOG_CLUE
    title: "Ch\xF3 s\u1EE7a \u0111\u1EA7u ng\xF5"
    body: "L\xFAc c\u1EA3 nh\xF3m \u0111i qua \u0111\u1EA7u ng\xF5, con ch\xF3 b\u1ED7ng s\u1EE7a. Kh\xF4ng r\xF5 n\xF3 nh\xECn g\xEC; Nam kh\xF4ng quy ti\u1EBFng s\u1EE7a cho m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3."
  - id: M1_BALLOON_CLUE
    title: "Qu\u1EA3 b\xF3ng \u0111\u1ECF"
    body: "Gi\u1EEFa \u0111\xEAm \u0111i v\u1EC7 sinh, Nam th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t qu\u1EA3 b\xF3ng \u0111\u1ECF l\u01A1 l\u1EEDng ngo\xE0i h\xE0nh lang, s\u1EE3i d\xE2y c\u0103ng nh\u01B0 c\xF3 ai gi\u1EEF.\n\nL\xFAc quay v\u1EC1, qu\u1EA3 b\xF3ng n\u1EB1m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ph\xF2ng ng\u1EE7. C\u1EA3nh n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 x\u1EA3y ra m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n. Kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\u1EA7m b\xF3ng."
  dialogues:
  - id: M1_BIA_TALK
    speaker: Bia
    lines:
    - "\u1EDE \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EA5y h\xF4m m\xE0 c\u1EADu v\u1EABn \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED3 trong ba l\xF4 \xE0? D\u1ECDn h\u1EBFt \u0111i cho r\u1ED9ng."
    - "B\xE0 h\u1ECD h\xE0ng cho thu\xEA r\u1EBB, \u0111\u1ED5i l\u1EA1i m\xECnh nh\u1EDB tr\xF4ng nh\xE0 gi\xFAp b\xE0. \u0110\u1EEBng l\xE0m m\u1EA5t ch\xECa kh\xF3a n\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EA5y."
  - id: M1_BANG_TALK
    speaker: "B\u0103ng"
    lines:
    - "H\xF4m nay t\u1EDB n\u1EA5u, mai t\u1EDBi l\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EADu nh\xE9. B\u1EBFp \u1EDF sau nh\xE0, \u0111i qua l\u1ED1i c\u1EA1nh c\u1EA7u thang."
    - "C\xF3 b\u1ED1n \u0111\u1EE9a th\xF4i, \u0111\u1EEBng l\u1EA5y d\u01B0 b\xE1t. \u0102n xong ai r\u1EA3nh th\xEC ph\u1EE5 r\u1EEDa."
  - id: M1_BAO_TALK
    speaker: "B\u1EA3o"
    lines:
    - "T\u1EDB ra h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u ng\xF5 mua th\xEAm g\xF3i m\xEC. C\u1EADu c\u1EA7n g\xEC th\xEC \u0111i c\xF9ng."
    - "Nh\xE0 v\u1EABn chia ph\xF2ng y nh\u01B0 h\u1ED3i ch\u1EE7 c\u0169 \u1EDF. Tr\xEAn t\u1EA7ng c\xF3 ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD ri\xEAng, v\xE0o th\xEC gi\u1EEF y\xEAn t\u0129nh nh\xE9."
  - id: M1_END_TALK
    speaker: "Bia \xB7 B\u0103ng \xB7 B\u1EA3o \xB7 Nam"
    lines:
    - "B\u0103ng: H\xF4m n\u1ECD ai l\u1EA5y th\xEAm c\xE1i b\xE1t nh\u1ECF th\u1EBF? T\u1EDB b\xE0y c\xF3 b\u1ED1n c\xE1i th\xF4i."
    - "Nam: T\u1EDB c\xF2n th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t qu\u1EA3 b\xF3ng ngo\xE0i h\xE0nh lang. L\xFAc \u0111i th\xEC n\xF3 l\u01A1 l\u1EEDng, l\xFAc v\u1EC1 l\u1EA1i n\u1EB1m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EEDa."
    - "B\u1EA3o: \u1EDE nh\xE0 c\u0169, nghe ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng l\xE0 b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng m\xE0. Hay th\u1EED V\u1ED7 Vai Ma cho vui?"
    - "Bia: B\u1ED1n \u0111\u1EE9a, b\u1ED1n g\xF3c. \u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xEC l\xE1t n\u1EEFa d\u1ECDn ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch r\u1ED3i ch\u01A1i."
    - "C\u1EA3 nh\xF3m c\u01B0\u1EDDi, \u0111\u1ED3ng \xFD. Kh\xF4ng ai bi\u1EBFt nh\xE0 t\u1EEBng c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u1EBFt."
  - id: DEMO_GAME_DIALOGUE
    speaker: Bia
    lines:
    - "M\u1ED7i \u0111\u1EE9a \u0111\u1EE9ng m\u1ED9t g\xF3c. T\u1EAFt \u0111\xE8n r\u1ED3i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111i d\u1ECDc t\u01B0\u1EDDng, v\u1ED7 vai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\u1EBF ti\u1EBFp."
    - "Ai \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c v\u1ED7 vai th\xEC ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c. \u0110\u1EBFn g\xF3c tr\u1ED1ng th\xEC d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i. Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 b\u1ED1n \u0111\u1EE9a m\xECnh th\xF4i m\xE0."
